<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's LG-Caltex to close crude unit Tuesday.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's LG-Caltex to close crude unit Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>LG-Caltex Oil Corp, a unit of South Korea's LG Group, will shut down one of its four crude distillation units on Tuesday for annual maintenance, a company spokesman said on Monday.</p>
<p>LG-Caltex's 130,000 barrels-per-day (bpd) No 2 unit is scheduled to resume operation on May 15, he said.</p>
<p>LG-Caltex is South Korea's second-largest oil refiner with a refining capacity of 600,000 bpd.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
